UTYthg1GmYnZVQY4KbtQXgkCQU8w-kLEE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxPGg5iCzGv64OV03TP-Tm_qF4InIcd2viYeRPKua_zGg&oe=69B7F08B"}, "display_name": "Oxford Medical Simulation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "At Oxford Medical Simulation (OMS), we deliver immersive, virtual reality clinical experiences on-demand. Our clinically-led approach creates rich, complex scenarios allowing healthcare professionals to learn from experience: practicing more, making fewer mistakes and improving patient care.\n\nLearners are immersed in clinical environments with dynamic, engaging virtual patients in true-to-life clinical scenarios, independent of faculty facilitation. Learners can see multiple patients, conversing, assessing, managing, and engaging with interdisciplinary teams. Learners receive a guided debrief, automated, intelligent feedback, performance metrics, and blended learning. \n\nOMS offers a wide range of standardized, repeatable, flexible, faculty-free scenarios. From ED, med-surg, OB, mental health, and peds to procedures, communication skills, and advanced cardiac life support codes, choose from over 200 scenarios that can be used in VR and on-screen. ", "short_description": "Oxford Medical Simulation delivers immersive virtual reality clinical experiences on-demand. Our clinically-led approach creates rich, complex clinical scenarios where you can investigate, interpret, and practice your clinical skills, training in world-class patient care without risking lives."}]}, "developer_name": "Oxford Medical Simulation", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www1.oms-app.com/pages/privacy_cookies", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www1.oms-app.com/pages/terms_and_conditions", "publisher_name": "Oxford Medical Simulation", "support_website_url": "https://intercom.help/oxford-medical-simulation/en", "website_url": "https://oxfordmedicalsimulation.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "con